ore possible scenarios; it does not claim certainty about The Future.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7f41-8d65-bc040868bd58","description":"The Future","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-71fb-8043-a096a0f463a8","description":"Science Fiction","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7d70-ac6c-6b72ef45fa2e","description":"Palm Reading","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7ed6-9a5f-58e329afd742","description":"Drugs","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-731b-bd37-2bedd007617d","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which organs do most fish use to breathe underwater?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Fish gills extract dissolved oxygen from water passing over them.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-78a4-82fb-6df65e70a2ba","description":"Gills","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-73e6-b628-4c15281aef34","description":"Lungs","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-708f-8479-2074b923d9d6","description":"Fins","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7c88-83ef-2f58881256c0","description":"Scales","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-71ba-b5e1-83c83909342b","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which condition is NOT genetically caused?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Tetanus is caused by a toxin made by Clostridium tetani bacteria, not by inherited genetic changes. Vaccination can prevent it.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7aa1-a6e6-16607b2d82c1","description":"Tetanus","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-75c9-94d7-bd3e7b798e14","description":"Down syndrome","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7c32-93a4-17af63eb4121","description":"Cystic fibrosis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-729e-8377-a5cd9fb9ea1e","description":"Sickle-cell disease","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad4f-7db6-b5aa-16be2806cd74","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is the name of the space telescope that was placed